      "id": "claim_7edbb4f8d8be44a7887815c089588689",
      "statement": "RaindropService performs business validation (config lookup, enabled check, collection selection) before calling RaindropApiClient, while RaindropApiClientImpl carries the @CircuitBreaker(name=\"raindrop\") and @Retry(name=\"raindrop\") annotations on a separate Spring bean so self-invocation never bypasses the Resilience4j AOP proxy.",
