      "id": "claim_5dbb485df49b498bb8c353acf6184d01",
      "statement": "RaindropApiClientImpl's listCollectionsFallback and createBookmarkFallback methods rethrow RaindropNotConfiguredException as-is and wrap every other throwable as IllegalStateException(\"Raindrop.io is currently unavailable\", throwable), and RaindropNotConfiguredException is listed under ignore-exceptions for both the raindrop circuit breaker and retry instances in application.yaml so an unconfigured token never opens the breaker or burns a retry attempt.",
